I'm a game dev (mostly C# before this) and wrote a zip generator for JS. Not sure how idiomatic it is, so I'd appreciate your feedback:
```js
function* zip(...its) {
  const iters = its.map(i => i[Symbol.iterator]());
  while (true) {
    const rs = iters.map(i => i.next());
    if (rs.some(r => r.done)) { iters.forEach(i => i.return?.()); return; }
    yield rs.map(r => r.value);
  }
}
```

