Our family does Secret Santa every year, so I coded the draw. I wanted nobody to get themselves. Would you take a look?
```js
function secretSanta(names) {
  const to = [...names];
  for (let i = to.length - 1; i > 0; i--) {
    const j = Math.floor(Math.random() * i);
    [to[i], to[j]] = [to[j], to[i]];
  }
  return Object.fromEntries(names.map((n, i) => [n, to[i]]));
}
```

