Working on a scroll animation for my photography portfolio site. Here's my throttle. What's your opinion?
```js
const rafThrottle = fn => {
  let queued = false, lastArgs;
  return (...args) => {
    lastArgs = args;
    if (queued) return;
    queued = true;
    requestAnimationFrame(() => {
      queued = false;
      fn(...lastArgs);
    });
  };
};
```

